# Designing a Digital Learning Center &amp; the Art of Compromise.

**Authors:** Dow, Raymond, Legaspi, Marlon, Tiedemann, David

## Abstract
Presents a three-year case study of the conceptualization, design, funding, construction, and the installation and implementation of instructional systems for an instructional facility built in renovated office space at Syracuse University's School of Information Studies. The Digital Learning Center is a 48-seat technology classroom with distance education and corporate presentation elements. (Author/LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ613412

